{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜の８時に寝て、今、目が覚めたよ～(*_*)\nブログ書かなきゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、\nみなさんに、お伝えがあるのです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...とうとう !"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたし、、、(  >_<  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪を、切ってしまいました～(  *^_^*  )えへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にこ～っ  ☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、ずっとショートにしたかったんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、きみはツインテールキャラだと言われ...(;_;)\nえーっと、うーんと、あのその...\nどうしたらいいのか... （ーー；）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、一年してやっと切ることができました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうさ！今までずっとショートヘアで生きてきたんだ！\n私と言ったら、ショートヘアじゃないかそうじゃないか！←知らない（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり、これが一番落ち着くし\n一番、私らしいですっ！(   ^ω^   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなからは、金八先生の生徒にいそう（笑）って\n言われました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜ私が金八先生、大好きだということがわかった！？ え（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仏ビーーーーーーームっ＼(^o^)／←これ今自分の中でめっちゃ流行ってる（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな使ってね仏ビーーーーーム！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪を切ってもさゆにゃんは\nさゆにゃんだよ～っ＼(^o^)／にゃんにゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の握手会は、よろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな、ショートにゃん を見にきてくれよなっ(^_−)−☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美雲ちゃん、明日は初めてだけどよろしくねっ(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美雲ちゃんファンの皆さんも、よろしくお願いします( ´･_･`)＿`)ﾍﾟｺﾘ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと私は緊張しいだから、\n緊張しちゃうかもだけど\nたくさんお話したいですっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう、私、整体に通ってるんですけど、\n今日、久しぶりに行ったら\n肩から腰まで、ひどくこってて\nめっちゃ痛くて(>_<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イテテ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事のときとか、人とお話する時も、\nあがり症で、いつも緊張しちゃって、\nすごく身体に力が入ってしまうクセがあるので\n気をつけなきゃなって思います(^_^;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは、緊張って、どうやって\nほぐしてますか(´･_･`)？\n良い案あったら、教えてくださいっ(  >_<  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、今日は、せいたんと\nカラオケに行きました(  ^ω^  )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたんラブっ(*^^*)\nいつも有難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の晩ごはんにね、ワンタンを食べたんだけど\nハートマークのネギを見っけて\n可愛かったです(  *^_^*  )♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それだけで、なんだか ほっこり\n幸せな気持ち ＾＾○°"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんのところにも、小さな幸せが\n訪れますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、再び眠りにつきます（＾-＾）☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/14/4735843/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}